Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.74,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Coco Gauff continues to refuse to lose{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科科 高芙仍保持不败
