Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:10.70,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}号夜场 中网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:12.18,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.18,0:00:14.06,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}第一次参加巡回赛正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.06,0:00:16.34,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}已经连赢两场 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:18.85,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}她面对世界第{\fs78}4{\fs68}高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:21.93,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}先看首盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}这一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:23.88,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}孙心然连续从底线抽击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:27.68,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}扛住高芙的回球 最后保发 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:31.24,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Dip below sixty degrees Fahrenheit,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N气温降到华氏六十度以下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:32.86,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}low teens Celsius.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也就是摄氏十几度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.90,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Quality stuff from the youngster.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位小将打得真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.66,0:00:56.06,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}下一局 高芙把球打得更深
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:59.35,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}孙心然退到底线后 仍然继续抽击
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:02.10,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}看她怎样把这一分争回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:30.24,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She just continues to bash the ball.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她还在不断大力击球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:32.82,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, just continue to watch.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我是说 继续看下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:36.24,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Sun is back on the lettering on the court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然又退到场上字母标志处
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.42,0:01:39.76,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But here, it’s all right in front of her.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而现在 机会就在她眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:55.06,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}孙心然随后{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:56.75,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}但那是高芙的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.75,0:01:58.94,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}不是孙心然拿到了盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:01.92,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}高芙追平 再拿下孙心然的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.92,0:02:03.34,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.46,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Coco Gauff back out in front{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科科 高芙再度领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:12.04,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the first time in forty minutes,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是四十分钟来的第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:14.12,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she’s got triple set point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她拿到了三个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:17.90,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it’s a swing and a miss.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍挥空了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:19.78,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that’s a little deflated look.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的神情有些低落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.88,0:02:22.42,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The shoulders have fallen for Sun Xinran,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然垂下了肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.42,0:02:25.90,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because Coco Gauff finds a way to earn the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N因为科科 高芙设法拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:27.86,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It wasn’t easy, but she gets it done{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N并不容易 但她还是拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:28.90,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in just short of an hour.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用时不到一小时
