Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:18.04,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}孙心然以{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}告负
