Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:34.13,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coco, relentless.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科科毫不松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:36.33,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She loves the middle of the court today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天她很喜欢利用场地中路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:59.67,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Coco Gauff continues to refuse to lose{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科科 高芙仍保持不败
