Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:06.87,TL,,0,0,357,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, on paper{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从纸面实力看
